  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Paleti Siva Nagaraju vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 28 January, 2021 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.382 of 2021 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioner is the sole accused in Crime No.328 of 2020 of Eluru I Town Police Station, West Godavari district, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 270, 273 IPC, Section 22 of the Cigarettes and Other Tobacco Products (Prohibition of Advertisement and Regulation of Trade and Commerce, Production, Supply and Distribution) Act, 2003 (for short \"COTP Act\") and Section 26(2)(iv) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (for short \"F.S.S. Act\"). When the petitioner sought quash of the said F.I.R before this Court in Criminal Petition No.6183 of 2020, the same was [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court. Therefore, the petitioner is entitled for recovery of the products that were seized from his possession during the course of investigation.",
